+# MCP API usage
+
+Endpoints:
+- POST /model-context — upsert a model context JSON (see OpenAPI spec).
+- GET /model-context/{model_id}/{version} — retrieve context.
+- GET /models — list models.
+- POST /subscriptions — register webhook subscribers.
+
+Auth:
+- API expects Authorization: Bearer &lt;JWT or token&gt;. In production configure OIDC and validate tokens.
+
+Integrations:
+- CI should upsert after evidence bundle generation.
+- Rekor/Vault adapters post attestations to MCP.
+- n8n/hil/workflows can query MCP for context and subscribe to updates.
